# The build context of packages/docs/Dockerfile alone. BuildKit reads a
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the one at the repository root, so
# this widens the context for this build without touching the root file, whose
# deny-all keeps the four image contexts down to install.sh.
#
# Nested re-inclusion needs every level spelled out: an exception cannot reach
# into a folder the line above excluded, so packages/ is let back in before its
# children are filtered.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!imgs
!packages
packages/*
!packages/docs

# The landing page is built from the repository README and the CLI one
# (plugins/readme). The second is the only thing this build wants from
# services/, so every level is spelled out, as above: an exception cannot reach
# into a folder the line before it excluded.
!README.md
!services
services/*
!services/dispat
services/dispat/*
!services/dispat/README.md

# .git is here on purpose: showLastUpdateTime reads the history of every page.
!.git

# Everything under the package that is output rather than source. node_modules
# in particular must not be copied over the tree pnpm installed in the image.
packages/docs/node_modules
packages/docs/build
packages/docs/.docusaurus
packages/docs/.cache-loader
